faction-balance-job-locked = { $faction } is at its population cap ({ $count }/{ $cap }). It reopens as the other factions fill up or as its own players leave.
faction-balance-join-refused = { $faction } is at its population cap ({ $count }/{ $cap }) and cannot take another player right now. Pick another faction, or wait for the numbers to even out.
faction-defeated-job-locked = { $faction } has lost its station and cannot accept players for the rest of the round.
faction-defeated-join-refused = { $faction } has lost its station and cannot accept players for the rest of the round. Pick another faction.
